      "text": "1.7 PUBLICATION, IMPLEMENTATION, EVALUATION AND EXPIRY DATE",
      "font": "TheSansSemiBold-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        42.55520248413086,
        60.276031494140625,
        399.64825439453125,
        69.27603149414062
      ],
      "text": "This document will be published in English in hard copies and will also be available on the",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        42.48320388793945,
        72.27304077148438,
        399.72003173828125,
        81.27304077148438
      ],
      "text": "WHO web site. The Stop TB department will work closely with the WHO regional and country",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        42.546207427978516,
        84.27005004882812,
        399.882568359375,
        93.27005004882812
      ],
      "text": "ofﬁces, the Stop TB Partnership and partners involved in tuberculosis control services to ensure",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        42.7262077331543,
        96.26705932617188,
        399.6686096191406,
        105.27603149414062
      ],
      "text": "its wide dissemination. It will be translated into French, Spanish and Russian and distributed",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        42.50368881225586,
        108.27304077148438,
        399.6776428222656,
        117.27304077148438
      ],
      "text": "through the appropriate networks. It will be presented and promoted at global meetings and",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        42.512691497802734,
        120.27005004882812,
        400.0195617675781,
        129.27005004882812
      ],
      "text": "conferences as well as at meetings of national TB programme managers in the WHO regions.",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        42.476688385009766,
        132.26705932617188,
        399.7044372558594,
        141.26705932617188
      ],
      "text": "Regional workshops will be organized on investigation of TB contacts in order to promote use",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        42.53969192504883,
        144.26406860351562,
        399.7222900390625,
        153.26406860351562
      ],
      "text": "of these guidelines. The document will be promoted in countries through Global Fund",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        42.55768966674805,
        156.26107788085938,
        299.2088928222656,
        165.27908325195312
      ],
      "text": "proposals, the TBREACH mechanism and other relevant initiatives.",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        42.528995513916016,
        174.27603149414062,
        399.720703125,
        183.27603149414062
      ],
      "text": "Implementation of the guidelines and use of the recommendations will be evaluated in",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        42.546993255615234,
        186.27304077148438,
        399.73870849609375,
        195.27304077148438
      ],
      "text": "collaboration with WHO regional and country ofﬁces and with partners to identify potential",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        42.57399368286133,
        198.27005004882812,
        336.0458679199219,
        207.27005004882812
      ],
      "text": "barriers to implementation and to assess the outcomes of implementation.",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        42.5829963684082,
        216.27005004882812,
        399.8019714355469,
        225.27005004882812
      ],
      "text": "The WHO Stop TB Department will review and update these guidelines 3–5 years after their",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        42.63699722290039,
        228.26705932617188,
        291.99725341796875,
        237.27606201171875
      ],
      "text": "publication or as needed when new evidence becomes available.",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
